{"step_index":219,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-14T00:28:42Z","thinking":"Preparing a script to populate missing business numbers is the next step while a separate process completes. Examining the data source reveals the structure of returned article details. Initial tests will involve fetching data for a few sample companies from the CSV to validate the retrieval process.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":"{\"RequestFeedback\":false,\"Summary\":\"Test article fields for company with business number\",\"UserFacing\":false}","CodeContent":"\"async function testArticle(b) {\\n    const clean = b.replace(/[^0-9]/g, '');\\n    const url = 'https://bizno.net/article/' + clean;\\n    const res = await fetch(url, {\\n        headers: { 'User-Agent': 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36' }\\n    });\\n    const html = await res.text();\\n    const text = html.replace(/<[^>]+>/g, ' ').replace(/\\\\s+/g, ' ');\\n\\n    console.log(`=== Results for ${b} ===`);\\n\\n    const estabM = text.match(/설립일[^\\\\:]*:\\\\s*([0-9]{4})-([0-9]{1,2})-([0-9]{1,2})/);\\n    console.log('설립일:', estabM ? `${estabM[1]}년 ${estabM[2]}월` : 'none');\\n\\n    const ceoM = text.match(/대표자명\\\\s*:\\\\s*([^\\\\s]+)/);\\n    console.log('대표자명:', ceoM ? ceoM[1] : 'none');\\n\\n    const telM = text.match(/전화번호\\\\s*:\\\\s*([0-9\\\\-]+)/);\\n    console.log('전화번호:', telM ? telM[1] : 'none');\\n\\n    const faxM = text.match(/팩스번호\\\\s*:\\\\s*([0-9\\\\-]+)/);\\n    console.log('팩스번호:', faxM ? faxM[1] : 'none');\\n\\n    const addrM = text.match(/회사주소\\\\s*:\\\\s*([^\\\"]+?)(?=\\\\s*\\\\(우|\\\\s*대표자|\\\\s*사업자등록번호|\\\\s*종업원수|\\\\s*설립일|\\\\s*$)/);\\n    console.log('회사주소:', addrM ? addrM[1].trim() : 'none');\\n\\n    const statusM = text.match(/사업자\\\\s*현재\\\\s*상태[^\\\\:]*:\\\\s*([^\\\\s]+)/);\\n    console.log('상태:', statusM ? statusM[1] : 'none');\\n\\n    // 폐업일자\\n    const closeM = text.match(/폐업일자\\\\s*:\\\\s*([0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2})/);\\n    console.log('폐업일자:', closeM ? closeM[1] : 'none');\\n\\n    const empM = text.match(/종업원수\\\\s*:\\\\s*([0-9]+)명/);\\n    console.log('종업원수:', empM ? empM[1] : 'none');\\n}\\n\\nasync function run() {\\n    await testArticle('243-86-01731');\\n    await testArticle('605-25-68583'); // Closed company\\n}\\n\\nrun();\\n\"","Description":"\"Test extraction of all company details from Bizno article\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\lg\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\22cde527-6a05-4644-ad41-9385bbc0ffd2\\\\scratch\\\\test_article_fields.js\"","toolAction":"\"Test article fields\"","toolSummary":"\"Test article fields\""}}]}
